[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:17.74]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:22.90]left a single note and went on their way
[00:28.12]I never got their name until the credits
[00:31.64]now it plays here every single day
[00:35.10]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:37.80]One note at a time
[00:43.14]from people passing through
[00:45.28]a name beside a line
[00:53.16]and part of it is you
[00:58.66]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
